  "releaseNotes": "1.0.24 Fixed formatting issue with very long entity names\n\t\t1.0.21 Fix issue with monaco editor\n\t\t1.0.20 Fix an issue with replacement tokens not being processed properly in MessageSender component\n\t\t1.0.19 Improved settings persistence using local storage in the UI\n\t\t1.0.17 Add support for container connectivity using podman\n\t\t1.0.13 Added logging to entity discovery\n\t\t1.0.10 add support for entity names containing periods\n\t\t1.0.9 Tie extension method to specific docker image tag\n\t\t1.0.6 add semver tag to docker image build workflow and AddAsbEmulatorUI() extension method\n\t\t1.0.2 net10.0\n\t\t1.0.1 moved some Types and removed an incorrect dependency\n\t\t1.0.0 initial version",
